<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>First Web Task</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="/css/responsive.css"
      media="screen and (max-width: 1000px)"
    />

    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/7.0.1/css/all.min.css"
      integrity="sha512-2SwdPD6INVrV/lHTZbO2nodKhrnDdJK9/kg2XD1r9uGqPo1cUbujc+IYdlYdEErWNu69gVcYgdxlmVmzTWnetw=="
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
    />
    <link rel="dns-prefetch" href="//fonts.googleapis.com" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <header>
      <ul class="left">
        <li class="list contact">Quick Contact</li>
        <li class="list">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i> +61 (0) 3 8376 6284
        </li>
        <li class="list">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> noreply@envato.com
        </li>
      </ul>
      <ul class="right">
        <i class="fa-brands fa-facebook-f"></i>
        <i class="fa-brands fa-twitter"></i>
        <i class="fa-brands fa-vimeo-v"></i>
        <i class="fa-brands fa-youtube"></i>
        <i class="fa-brands fa-flickr"></i>
        <i class="fa-brands fa-pinterest-p"></i>
        <i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin-in"></i>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-basketball"></i>
      </ul>
    </header>

    <div class="stickyheader">
      <div class="logo-section">
        <div class="logo">
          <img class="logo-img" src="./Pics/logo.png" alt="No pic found" />
        </div>

        <div class="bars">
          <i onclick="shownavbar()" class="fa-solid fa-bars"></i>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul class="top-bar">
        <div class="box" id="home">
          <li class="l first"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li class="l second">BeVoyager</li>
        </div>
        <div class="box">
           <li class="l first"><a href="/api">Api</a></li>
          <li class="l second">Our history</li>
        </div>
        <div class="box">
           <li class="l first"><a href="/cv">My Cv</a></li>
          <li class="l second">What's new</li>
        </div>
        <div class="box">
           <li class="l first"><a href="/buynow">Buynow</a></li>
          <li class="l second">We have been</li>
        </div>
        <div class="box">
          <li class="l first"><a href="/contactus">Contact</a></li>
          <li class="l second">Stay in touch</li>
        </div>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="bg">
      <img src="/Pics/bg.jpg" alt="  No Pic found"/>
    </div>

    

    <hr />
    <%-body %>
    <hr />

    <div class="bottom-bar">
      <img class="end-car" src="/Pics/footer.png" alt="  No pic found" />
      <img class="end-pic" src="/Pics/footer3.jpg" alt="  No pic found" />
      <div class="end-content">
        <div class="section latest">
          <h3>Latest Comments</h3>
          <li class="date-circle">
            <div class="date-sec">
              <div class="circle"></div>
              <span class="date">December 31, 2014</span>
            </div>

            <p class="comment">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i> <strong>Sara</strong> commented
              on
              <a href=""
                >Vestibulum ante ipsum primis in nulla orcinec cursus consequat
                lacus
              </a>
            </p>
          </li>
        </div>
        <div class="section secLinks">
          <h3>Useful links</h3>
          <ul class="links">
            <li>
              <a href="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/voyager/wp-login.php"
                >Log in</a
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/voyager/feed/"
                >Entries feed</a
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/voyager/comments/feed/"
                >Comments feed</a
              >
            </li>
            <li><a href="https://wordpress.org/">WordPress.org</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="section about-sec">
          <h3>About us</h3>
          <p class="about">
            Interdum nulla lectus vel justo. Curabitur fringilla nisi a ex.
          </p>
          <p>
            Praesent vel iaculis erat. Mauris congue tortor a aliquam sodales.
            Duis quis odio id dolor fermentum bibendum. Nam iaculis viverra
            urna.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="section tag-sec">
          <h3>Popular Tags</h3>
          <li class="tags">
            <a
              class="tags-link"
              href="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/voyager/tag/design/"
              >Design
            </a>
            <a
              class="tags-link"
              href="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/voyager/tag/framework/"
              >Framework</a
            ><a
              class="tags-link"
              href="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/voyager/tag/grid/"
              >Grid</a
            ><a
              class="tags-link"
              href="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/voyager/tag/motion/"
              >Motion</a
            ><a
              class="bigtags"
              href="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/voyager/tag/video/"
              >Video</a
            ><a
              class="bigtags"
              href="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/voyager/tag/wordpress/"
              >Wordpress</a
            >
          </li>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <ul class="footer-top">
        <li>
          © 2025 Betheme by <a class="footerlink" href="">Muffin group </a> |
          All Rights Reserved | Powered by
          <a
            class="footerlink"
            href="https://themes.muffingroup.com/be/voyager/tag/wordpress/"
            >WordPress</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
      <ul class="right footer-bottom">
        <i class="fa-brands fa-facebook-f"></i>
        <i class="fa-brands fa-twitter"></i>
        <i class="fa-brands fa-vimeo-v"></i>
        <i class="fa-brands fa-youtube"></i>
        <i class="fa-brands fa-flickr"></i>
        <i class="fa-brands fa-pinterest-p"></i>
        <i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin-in"></i>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-basketball"></i>
      </ul>
    </footer>

    <script src="/js/scripts.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
